@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1a. Login Ana (espera 201)
# @name loginAna
POST {{host}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@taskboard.test", "password": "password123", "dispositivo": "rest-ana" }

### 1b. Login Carlos (espera 201)
# @name loginCarlos
POST {{host}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carlos@taskboard.test", "password": "password123", "dispositivo": "rest-carlos" }

### 2. Login con clave incorrecta (espera 422)
POST {{host}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@taskboard.test", "password": "incorrecta", "dispositivo": "rest-ana" }

@tokenAna = {{loginAna.response.body.token}}
@tokenCarlos = {{loginCarlos.response.body.token}}

### 3. Sin token (espera 401)
GET {{host}}/comercios
Accept: application/json

### 3b. Sin token y SIN Accept (espera 302 / HTML)
GET {{host}}/comercios

### 4. Yo Ana (espera 200, Ana López)
GET {{host}}/yo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### 4b. Yo Carlos (espera 200, Carlos)
GET {{host}}/yo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarlos}}

### 5. Comercios de Ana (espera 200, 2 comercios)
GET {{host}}/comercios
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### 6. Comercios de Carlos (espera 200, 1 comercio)
GET {{host}}/comercios
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarlos}}

### 7. Ana pide el comercio 2 (espera 404)
GET {{host}}/comercios/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### 8. Ana crea en comercio de Carlos (espera 422)
POST {{host}}/transacciones
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

{ "comercio_id": 2, "cliente_nombre": "Prueba", "monto": 10 }

### 9a. Transacciones de Ana (para sacar un id)
# @name transAna
GET {{host}}/transacciones
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### 9b. Carlos borra una transacción de Ana (espera 404)
# Envía antes la 9a: el id se toma de su respuesta
DELETE {{host}}/transacciones/{{transAna.response.body.$.data[0].id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCarlos}}

### 10a. Logout de Ana (espera 204). ENVIAR AL FINAL
POST {{host}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### 10b. Yo con el token revocado (espera 401)
GET {{host}}/yo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
